--[[
    REXZ UI LIBRARY (SIDEBAR & TAB EDITION)
    Features: Responsive Drag, Auto-Canvas Scaling, Icon Injection, 
              Dynamic Search Bar Filter, Floating Toggle Button, Sidebar Tab System
    Language Lock: Indonesian Professional
--]]

